{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60ce8afe4ddd21f7ea2161d7da727260cf2d3d465209f6891c95c8180869cfad", "ja": "（未来が劇場に来ているらしい。たしか今日は\nオフだったような？　ちょっと顔を見に行ってみるか）", "zh": "（听说未来好像在剧场。记得今天应该是休息日吧？去看看她在干什么吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "e1fd2afa5d84e778be52304b87dc07441dfb6a261e1b3e5837218e6018a91298", "ja": "あー！　{$P$}さんだー♪\nこんなところで、何してるんですか？", "zh": "啊——！是{$P$}先生♪\n在这种地方做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c11c02ad9786e06ecd9c3a7cbe2b563fca59594ea03d43a1750c17eb97a6f94e", "ja": "未来が来てるって聞いたから、挨拶しにきたんだ。\nしかし、どうしたんだ？　今日はオフだったよな？", "zh": "听说未来来了，所以我过来打个招呼。\n不过，你这是怎么了？今天不是休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "87c98e113ab9ba5fb61ab5bc9cd5ee0a03607982b59be6e77e4d78c8851a0383", "ja": "えへへ♪　これから静香ちゃんと翼とデートなんです。\nケーキがおいしいお店に行くって言ってました。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 我接下来要和静香还有翼去约会。\n听说要去一家蛋糕很好吃的店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f1b4b12e1d2ec3cb841901c028bac145059af9250f927b4c3f4d3d118ab94843", "ja": "おお、いいじゃないか。\nあ、だから、いつもよりオシャレしてるんだな！", "zh": "哦，不错嘛。\n啊，所以你今天才打扮得比平时更漂亮啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "54811fc1adf277d19c5957bf6076fdde31e28c3192075a9c416fea84b2675d7b", "ja": "はい！　実はこの服、3人で出かけた時に\n買ったんです。翼が、私に似合う服を選んでくれて。", "zh": "是的！其实这件衣服，是和3个人一起出门时买的。翼帮我选了适合我的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "8b0a3b06e1c7ec9001864c27700fd9f245711505040eb45293cc5164d6b95116", "ja": "静香ちゃんも、似合ってるって！\n私もすっごく気に入ったから、着てきちゃいました！", "zh": "静香也说很适合我！\n我自己也特别喜欢，所以就穿来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8c659595a1dc88c868650880419ce06c3f5e4e5c3460b71ff5193923ae468aa4", "ja": "そうだったのか。翼の見立てなら間違いないからな。\nうん、未来にピッタリだ！", "zh": "原来是这样啊。既然是翼挑的，那就不会错。\n嗯，和未来特别相配！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "09c1eb0e30de194c3f4142a6b93ff158dccd99ad04f1eb99a7106294a352c393", "ja": "でへへ……。そんな風にほめられると、\n照れちゃいますよ～。でも、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……被这样夸奖的话，\n人家会害羞的啦～不过，还是谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "2858fa5eb6e4128f6479e2003c24740565b88c04c27374bdcf17f405f7e6b302", "ja": "あっ、そうだ！　{$P$}さんも、\n私たちと一緒にケーキ食べに行きませんか？", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}先生也要不要和我们一起去吃蛋糕？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b274b374659abfd4e88e67302fbb0453944a781181ccd45aca7e3ce970631129", "ja": "誘ってくれて嬉しいけど……まだ仕事が残っててな。\n今日は無理だけど、近いうちに予定を立てようか。", "zh": "谢谢你们邀请……不过我还有工作没做完。今天恐怕不行，但近期找个时间约一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "e989af4f46fd9d423dfc15f0805fa59300b60f3e89610bfeac64aed316c4865d", "ja": "本当ですかー！？　えへへ、やったやった～！\n{$P$}さん、絶対ですよ！", "zh": "真的吗——！？嘿嘿，太好了太好了～！{$P$}先生，说定了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fccf9d68179403dac79513c30ee8a5db40f5346a8a0e269c7b8a8bffff9705f1", "ja": "ああ。未来たちがどんなケーキを食べるのかとか……\n十代の、トレンドや嗜好を知りたいと思って。", "zh": "啊。比如未来她们会吃什么蛋糕之类的……我想了解一下十几岁孩子的流行趋势和喜好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "c9022b7d2a57607e3f0f73e078e13cf4e6ef049bac1e1258f895a9ca03e244f2", "ja": "なるほど～！　でも私、どのケーキを食べるか\nいつも迷っちゃって……なかなか決められないんです。", "zh": "原来如此～！不过我每次都会纠结该吃哪种蛋糕……总是很难决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "952540dd32a2d54e9500b65d74b139377b67c496289ac6917cdecd6279d3f3cd", "ja": "だから私じゃ、{$P$}さんの\n参考にならないかも……。", "zh": "所以，我可能没法给{$P$}先生提供参考……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1f50d4106c6a8545d1a318cee04e0c54dbfd385fd607917059f5890e3bf1d3cf", "ja": "そんなことないさ。未来がいろんなことに興味がある\nってわかっただけでも、充分参考になるよ。", "zh": "没那回事。光是知道未来对各种事情都感兴趣，就已经很有参考价值了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "69f5c4ad95055b628915af0b2acc1b01e13cdb00a980988bbc57d4a8776bd659", "ja": "そうなんですか？　それなら私、\n食べたいケーキ、ぜーんぶ頼んじゃいます！", "zh": "是这样吗？那我就把想吃的蛋糕全都点一遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "c1b16373a6a29957fe65bdb998d7eb3528c901c2111bbcd620cffc0d60192194", "ja": "って、そんなことしたら、静香ちゃん怒るかも……。\nうう～。でもでも、いっぱい食べたいし……。", "zh": "可是，要是那样做的话，静香可能会生气……  \n呜呜～可是可是，我想吃好多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1018_p", "source_sha256": "e83042c96402eb6b33980a1702c2cc5f1b90cadefbed19894753979609a138e2", "ja": "いいんじゃないか？　俺も食べるのを手伝うし、\n無駄にならないなら静香も怒らないだろう……多分。", "zh": "有什么不好的？我也会帮忙吃，\n只要不浪费的话，静香应该也不会生气的吧……大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "cb91385032ea66c955e4bf607b9f400c4d88fcfa1ceb01747c60c58eb5edb02c", "ja": "そうですね！　えへへ。\n生クリームのケーキ、いっぱい頼んじゃおーっと！", "zh": "是啊！嘿嘿。\n奶油蛋糕，我要点好多好多——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1020_p", "source_sha256": "16672844a25dd0b8cf9db32800d3f523090539b7009ab121cde78f4f75ab3809", "ja": "ははっ。それじゃ、あとで予定を確認してみるよ。\nみんなとのデート、楽しんでおいで！", "zh": "哈哈。那我之后确认一下安排吧。\n和大家一起约会，可要玩得开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "d90a698be8fa15604a21a8f18c64aa848641c3b7080e99ce617b11482c72aa34", "ja": "はーい！　今日はなんのケーキを食べようかな～。\n生クリーム？　うーん、チョコも食べたいなぁ……。", "zh": "好——！今天吃什么蛋糕好呢～  \n鲜奶油？嗯——巧克力也想吃啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0414_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d13d5275ae098b13513cf0959f09e97ad4a8317b0f32e164387cb3c60e988ff6", "ja": "（オシャレを楽しんだり、おいしいケーキを食べたり\n……未来の周りには、楽しみがいっぱいみたいだな！）", "zh": "（享受时尚，品尝美味的蛋糕……未来身边似乎充满了各种乐趣啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
